    "identity": "A six-storey honey-amber mass-timber apartment building exposes a continuous glulam post-and-beam grid around deep neutral low-iron glazing, alternating planted balcony bays, and a carved double-height central lobby; the set-back sixth floor opens to timber terraces beneath a roof divided between sedum, framed photovoltaic arrays and communal deck.",
